{
  "why": [
    "This repository's own output, recorded because `tools/asset_provenance.py` will not let a",
    "file that is somebody's work sit in the tree unaccounted for \u2014 ours included, since",
    "'we made it' is a claim and not an exemption.",
    "",
    "`produced_by` is the same command for every file here and it is executed rather than",
    "believed: `tools/test_synth_dataset.py` runs it with the output redirected elsewhere and",
    "compares every byte, so a renderer default that drifts away from what this command",
    "produces fails the build instead of ageing into fiction.",
    "",
    "What the fixture is for is ADR 0053: the loader is read against bytes this generator wrote",
    "rather than against its author's idea of the format. It is a format fixture and not a",
    "measurement \u2014 48x36 frames are a specimen, and the world accuracy is measured in is",
    "`core/test/data/panoramas` (ADR 0059)."
  ],
